Design: I propose adding simple test-time augmentation (TTA) by averaging predictions from the original and horizontally flipped inputs during validation and inference. This atomic change leverages model invariance to flips, improving robustness without modifying training. The validation loop and the `predict` function will both average logits from each view before applying the sigmoid. We keep all other training settings unchanged to isolate the effect of TTA.
