Design: I propose to replace the single 80/20 split with stratified 5‐fold cross‐validation, training a DenseNet121 on each fold and reporting per‐fold and mean AUROC. After CV, we retrain the model on the entire dataset for 5 epochs using the same settings and save this full‐data model for inference. This leverages all data for both robust evaluation and final training to improve generalization.
