Design: I propose adding a dropout layer before the final DenseNet121 classifier to reduce overfitting and improve generalization. We replace the single linear head with a small sequential block: Dropout(0.5) followed by Linear. All other settings—5‐fold CV with weighted sampling, TTA, and final retraining—remain unchanged so we can measure the isolated effect of this regularization. The predict function is updated to match the new head architecture.
